# Scheduled Task Creation Masquerading as System Processes | T1036.004, T1036.005, T1053.005 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_schtasks_system_process.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image="*\\schtasks.exe" OR OriginalFileName="schtasks.exe") (CommandLine="* -create *" OR CommandLine="* /create *" OR CommandLine="* –create *" OR CommandLine="* —create *" OR CommandLine="* ―create *") (CommandLine IN ("* audiodg*", "* conhost*", "* dwm.exe*", "* explorer*", "* lsass*", "* lsm*", "* mmc*", "* msiexec*", "* regsvr32*", "* rundll32*", "* services*", "* spoolsv*", "* svchost*", "* taskeng*", "* taskhost*", "* wininit*", "* winlogon*"))
